{"seq":3,"slug":"self-consistency","title":"自洽与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/foundations/self-consistency","wordCount":1610,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"自洽与采样\">自洽与采样</h1><p>一道难题，让模型解十遍，可能得到十条不同的推理路径——其中几条算错、几条算对。若把这十个最终答案摊开数一数，出现次数最多的那个，往往就是正确答案。这个朴素到近乎偷懒的想法，就是自洽（self-consistency）。它是对 <a href=\"cot-prompting\">思维链提示</a> 的最小增量改造，却是历史上第一种被广泛验证有效的测试时计算策略。本文专讲采样与聚合；把单链组织成可搜索结构的做法，属于 <a href=\"../search-planning/tree-of-thoughts\">思维树</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自洽建立在一个统计直觉上：一个难题通常只有一个正确答案，但通向它的正确路径有多条；而错误的路径则五花八门、彼此不一致。于是当我们用带随机性的采样（非贪心解码）生成多条 CoT 时，正确答案会因「条条大路通罗马」而反复出现，错误答案则因各错各的而分散。对答案做多数投票（marginalize over reasoning paths），就能把信号从噪声中提取出来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[问题 + CoT 提示] --&gt; B[温度采样&lt;br/&gt;生成 N 条推理路径]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[路径1 -&gt; 答案 a]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[路径2 -&gt; 答案 b]&#10;  B --&gt; C3[路径3 -&gt; 答案 a]&#10;  B --&gt; C4[路径N -&gt; 答案 a]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[抽取每条路径的最终答案]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  C3 --&gt; D&#10;  C4 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[对答案多数投票]&#10;  E --&gt; F[输出: 票数最高的 a]\">flowchart TD\n  A[问题 + CoT 提示] --&gt; B[温度采样&lt;br/&gt;生成 N 条推理路径]\n  B --&gt; C1[路径1 -&gt; 答案 a]\n  B --&gt; C2[路径2 -&gt; 答案 b]\n  B --&gt; C3[路径3 -&gt; 答案 a]\n  B --&gt; C4[路径N -&gt; 答案 a]\n  C1 --&gt; D[抽取每条路径的最终答案]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  C3 --&gt; D\n  C4 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[对答案多数投票]\n  E --&gt; F[输出: 票数最高的 a]</pre><p>形式上，设采样得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条路径，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 条给出答案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，自洽选取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{a} = \\arg\\max_{a} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\mathbb{1}[a_i = a]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。这正是对 <a href=\"cot-prompting\">思维链提示</a> 里那个隐变量边缘化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>r</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(a\\mid q)=\\sum_r P(a\\mid r,q)P(r\\mid q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的蒙特卡洛近似——只是用「答案出现频次」替代了对每条路径概率的精确加权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采样的关键旋钮\">采样的关键旋钮</h2><p>自洽的效果由几个超参数决定，理解它们才能把这招用对。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>调高的后果</th>\n<th>实践取向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>控制采样随机性</td>\n<td>路径更多样，但单条质量下降</td>\n<td>中等（如 0.5–0.8），太低退化为贪心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>投票样本量</td>\n<td>准确率上升但成本线性增长</td>\n<td>收益递减，常取 5–40</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>top-p / top-k</td>\n<td>截断采样分布</td>\n<td>影响多样性与稳健性</td>\n<td>配合温度防止离谱 token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>答案抽取规则</td>\n<td>从链中解析最终答案</td>\n<td>抽取不准会污染投票</td>\n<td>用结构化输出或正则锚定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>温度是核心矛盾：太低则所有路径几乎相同，投票退化、起不到稀释作用；太高则单条链质量崩坏，错误答案也开始变得多样而难以被票数压制。多样而不失质量，是甜区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"准确率与成本的权衡\">准确率与成本的权衡</h2><p>自洽是典型的「拿算力换正确率」，它把准确率写成了采样数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的函数。经验上，正确率随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 增长但迅速进入收益递减：从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 提升显著，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 则微乎其微。原因在于：当正确答案已是稳定多数时，再多采样也只是巩固既有多数。</p>\n<p>这就引出测试时计算的第一条朴素 scaling law：投入翻倍的推理算力（采样数翻倍），准确率的边际增益逐步衰减。如何更聪明地花这笔算力——例如用验证器给路径加权而非等权投票，或用搜索替代盲采样——正是 <a href=\"../test-time-compute/inference-scaling\">推理时扩展</a> 与 <a href=\"../test-time-compute/verification-self-correction\">验证与自我纠错</a> 要回答的。自洽是这条 scaling law 上最简单的一点。</p>\n<p>一个重要约束：原版自洽要求答案是可比较、可投票的离散量（数值、选项、可规范化的字符串）。对开放式生成（如长文、代码），「数票」失效，需要改用基于验证器或两两比较的聚合，这把我们引向后续章节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个可参照的聚合流程\">一个可参照的聚合流程</h2><p>把上面几个旋钮串起来，一次自洽推理的落地流程可以写成下表这样的固定步骤——每一步都对应一个可调的决策点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>做什么</th>\n<th>关键决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样</td>\n<td>用带温度的 CoT 提示跑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次</td>\n<td>温度与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽取</td>\n<td>从每条路径解析出最终答案</td>\n<td>用正则还是结构化输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规范化</td>\n<td>把等价答案归一（如统一单位、小数）</td>\n<td>归一规则的严格程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投票</td>\n<td>对归一后的答案计数、取众数</td>\n<td>等权还是加权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兜底</td>\n<td>出现平票或全不一致时如何处理</td>\n<td>升温度重采或退回单链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三步「规范化」常被忽视却影响很大：若 <code>0.5</code>、<code>1/2</code>、<code>50%</code> 未被归一到同一答案，投票会把本该合并的票拆散。这段流程用伪代码表达就是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"answers = [extract() for _ in range(N)]      # 采样 + 抽取&#10;answers = [normalize(a) for a in answers]    # 规范化&#10;winner  = most_common(answers)               # 多数投票&#10;return winner\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>answers = [extract() for _ in range(N)]      # 采样 + 抽取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>answers = [normalize(a) for a in answers]    # 规范化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>winner  = most_common(answers)               # 多数投票</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return winner</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自洽的变体与延伸\">自洽的变体与延伸</h2><p>围绕「采样—聚合」这个母题，社区发展出多种变体，理解它们有助于看清自洽在整个体系中的位置。</p>\n<p>加权自洽不再等权计票，而是用每条路径的生成概率或一个外部打分器给票加权——这其实是结果验证器（ORM）思路的萌芽，详见 <a href=\"../test-time-compute/verification-self-correction\">验证与自我纠错</a>。自适应采样则动态决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>：当前几条采样已高度一致就提前停手，省下算力，把固定预算变成按需预算。通用自洽把投票推广到无标准答案的场景：让模型自己读完多条候选，挑出最一致的那条。</p>\n<p>这些变体共同指向一个判断：自洽的本质不是「投票」这个动作，而是「用多条独立推理的一致性作为正确性的代理」。它的弱点也正在此——当模型在某类题上系统性地偏向同一个错误答案时，多数投票会把错误放大而非纠正。这种系统性偏差不是采样能解决的，需要更强的训练（<a href=\"../test-time-compute/reasoning-models-rl\">推理模型与强化学习</a>）或外部验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自洽对一题采样多条 CoT、对最终答案多数投票，是对单链 CoT 的最小改造，也是历史上第一种被广泛验证的测试时计算策略。</li>\n<li>它本质是对推理路径隐变量做蒙特卡洛边缘化，依赖「正确路径殊途同归、错误路径各错各的」这一统计直觉。</li>\n<li>温度与采样数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是核心旋钮；准确率随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 上升但收益递减，体现了测试时算力换正确率的第一条朴素 scaling law。</li>\n<li>自洽要求答案可投票，对开放式生成失效，且无法纠正系统性偏差——这些缺口分别由验证器加权、搜索结构与 RL 训练填补。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自洽与采样","id":"自洽与采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采样的关键旋钮","id":"采样的关键旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"准确率与成本的权衡","id":"准确率与成本的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可参照的聚合流程","id":"一个可参照的聚合流程"},{"level":2,"text":"自洽的变体与延伸","id":"自洽的变体与延伸"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"思维链提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/foundations/cot-prompting"},"next":{"title":"思维树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/search-planning/tree-of-thoughts"}}